  "message": "Metadate pentru versiunea publicată 4.0.0 (2026-10-23). Pentru citare folosiți metadatele acestei versiuni.",
  "type": "software",
  "title": "Explorare geospațială",
  "abstract": "Published 4.0.0 release. One recommended 24-step learning path with three final-project applications and unrestricted thematic exploration. Static educational GIS and cartography platform organized into seven academic sections and twenty interactive laboratories, complemented by QGIS workshops T01–T06. The laboratories provide Romanian/English interfaces and explanations; legacy lessons and workshops remain predominantly Romanian. Experiments include cartographic comparison, spatial analysis and explicitly identified synthetic models. The Zarr laboratory uses an embedded ANM/EOCube snapshot and modeled offline access, not a live cloud client. MIT applies only to original software; original educational text and graphics are CC BY 4.0; third-party resources retain their own licenses and permissions. The mixed archive is not exclusively MIT-licensed.",
